{"unit_id":"xchannel1987__dsh-session-xc#card-zh","repo":"xchannel1987/dsh-session-xc","commit":"dcf1715e49252aac5a91d8ac0ccd8056b8513af6","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-session-xc 是面向 DSH Web 客户端的会话管理插件，在工作区侧边栏显示活跃会话与已完成未读数量，并提供归档会话查看、恢复和删除、跨工作区拖拽移动、仅显示今天活跃会话的筛选，以及新会话首轮后自动生成标题。它通过客户端注入和 Host 端会话存储与 RPC 接入这些功能，设置卡可分别开关主要能力。首轮标题使用该会话配置的模型路由；不需要额外的插件专属 API Key。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client.js:475","src/index.js:959"]}
{"unit_id":"xchannel1987__dsh-session-xc#card-en","repo":"xchannel1987/dsh-session-xc","commit":"dcf1715e49252aac5a91d8ac0ccd8056b8513af6","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-session-xc adds session management to DSH Web workspaces: active and unread counts, archive restore and deletion, cross-workspace moves, an active-today filter, and first-round titles. Client UI connects to Host session storage and RPC. Title generation uses the session’s configured model route.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client.js:475","src/index.js:959"]}
