{"unit_id":"xchannel1987__dsh-session-xc#feature-feature-1","repo":"xchannel1987/dsh-session-xc","commit":"dcf1715e49252aac5a91d8ac0ccd8056b8513af6","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-session-xc 的功能「归档会话恢复与删除」：在工作区归档面板查看归档会话并恢复；也可删除已归档会话及其会话文件。通过客户端面板操作，服务端 RPC 更新归档状态。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client.js:475","src/index.js:975","src/index.js:1037"]}
{"unit_id":"xchannel1987__dsh-session-xc#feature-feature-2","repo":"xchannel1987/dsh-session-xc","commit":"dcf1715e49252aac5a91d8ac0ccd8056b8513af6","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-session-xc 的功能「跨工作区移动」：将会话拖到目标工作区即可移动；若会话仍由 Host 常驻，则移动会排队并在 DSH 重启后处理。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.js:991","src/index.js:1008"]}
{"unit_id":"xchannel1987__dsh-session-xc#feature-feature-3","repo":"xchannel1987/dsh-session-xc","commit":"dcf1715e49252aac5a91d8ac0ccd8056b8513af6","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-session-xc 的功能「会话数量徽标」：工作区行及抽屉标题显示活跃会话数；存在已完成未读会话时同时显示未读数。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client.js:475","src/client.js:578"]}
{"unit_id":"xchannel1987__dsh-session-xc#feature-feature-4","repo":"xchannel1987/dsh-session-xc","commit":"dcf1715e49252aac5a91d8ac0ccd8056b8513af6","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-session-xc 的功能「首轮自动命名」：新顶级会话的首轮结束后，插件可用该会话自身的非官方模型路由生成标题，并写入会话标题。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.js:942","src/index.js:1298"]}
{"unit_id":"xchannel1987__dsh-session-xc#caveat-1","repo":"xchannel1987/dsh-session-xc","commit":"dcf1715e49252aac5a91d8ac0ccd8056b8513af6","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-session-xc 使用首轮自动命名时，会将首轮用户提问和助手正文交给会话自身配置的模型路由生成标题；官方 deepseek-official 路由不会触发此调用。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.js:858","src/index.js:888","src/index.js:940"]}
